## Objective

Build the **Break Controls** component (integrated into the Clock page from Sprint 5) and the **My Hours** page where employees view their session history and submit disputes.

---

## Endpoints Consumed (6)

| # | Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
|---|--------|----------|---------|
| 1 | POST | `/api/v1/time-clock/sessions/:id/breaks/start` | Start a break on the active session |
| 2 | POST | `/api/v1/time-clock/sessions/:id/breaks/end` | End the active break |
| 3 | GET | `/api/v1/time-clock/sessions/:id/breaks` | List all breaks for a session |
| 4 | GET | `/api/v1/time-clock/sessions/mine` | Paginated history of own sessions |
| 5 | GET | `/api/v1/time-clock/sessions/:id` | Session detail (with breaks and edit log) |
| 6 | POST | `/api/v1/time-clock/sessions/:id/disputes` | Submit a dispute on a session |

