## Task 3 — My Hours Page

**What:** Build the My Hours page at `app/src/app/(dashboard)/workforce/my-hours/page.tsx`.

**Page:** `/workforce/my-hours`
**Roles:** Owner, Admin, Project Manager, Employee

**Layout:**

```
+-------------------------------------------+
| Breadcrumb: Workforce > My Hours          |
+-------------------------------------------+
| Summary Card                              |
| This Week: 32h 15m | Pay Period: 72h 30m |
+-------------------------------------------+
| Filters:                                  |
| [Date From] [Date To] [Project v] [Status]|
+-------------------------------------------+
| Sessions List (paginated)                 |
| +---------------------------------------+ |
| | Apr 10 | 8:00 AM - 4:30 PM | 8h 30m  | |
| | Project: Main St Renovation           | |
| | Status: [Completed] [Flagged]         | |
| +---------------------------------------+ |
| | Apr 9  | 7:30 AM - 3:00 PM | 7h 30m  | |
| | Project: Office Remodel               | |
| | Status: [Completed]                   | |
| +---------------------------------------+ |
| [< Prev] Page 1 of 5 [Next >]            |
+-------------------------------------------+
```

**Components:**
- **Summary card** at top: total hours this week, total hours this pay period (compute from session list or add summary endpoint if available)
- **Filters:** DateRangePicker (from/to), Select for project, Select for status (all/active/completed/on_break)
- **Session list:** paginated using `GET /time-clock/sessions/mine`
- **Each row:** date, clock-in time, clock-out time (or "Active"), duration (format `total_worked_minutes` as Xh Ym), project name, task name, status badge, flag badge (if `is_flagged`)
- **Tap/click row:** expand or navigate to session detail view
- **Pagination:** use existing `PaginationControls` component

**Session Detail View (expandable or modal):**
- Full session info: clock-in/out times with GPS coordinates
- Break list: each break with type (paid/unpaid), start/end times, duration
- Edit log: any manual edits with before/after values and editor name
- Dispute status: if a dispute exists, show its status, type, description
- "Submit Dispute" button (visible on completed sessions with no pending dispute)

---

## Task 4 — Dispute Submission

**What:** Build dispute submission from the My Hours session detail.

**"Submit Dispute" button** on each completed session (if no pending dispute exists).

**Modal: DisputeForm**
**File:** `app/src/components/time-clock/DisputeForm.tsx`

**Fields:**
- **Dispute Type** (required): Radio or Select
  - `flag_only` — "Flag for Review" (no time correction)
  - `correction_request` — "Request Correction" (propose new times)
- **Description** (required): `Textarea`, placeholder "Describe the issue with this session..."
- **If `correction_request` selected, show additional fields:**
  - `proposed_clock_in_at`: `DatePicker` + `TimePicker` combined
  - `proposed_clock_out_at`: `DatePicker` + `TimePicker` combined
  - `proposed_project_id`: project `Select` dropdown
  - `proposed_task_id`: task `Select` dropdown (optional)
  - `proposed_notes`: `Textarea` for proposed notes

**Submit:** POST `/time-clock/sessions/{sessionId}/disputes`
```json
{
  "dispute_type": "correction_request",
  "description": "My clock-in time was wrong, I started at 7:30 not 8:00",
  "proposed_clock_in_at": "2026-04-10T07:30:00Z",
  "proposed_clock_out_at": "2026-04-10T16:00:00Z",
  "proposed_project_id": "uuid",
  "proposed_task_id": "uuid",
  "proposed_notes": "Updated notes"
}
```

**Handle errors:**
- **409 Conflict**: "A dispute is already pending for this session" -> `ErrorModal`
- **400 Bad Request**: Validation errors -> show field-level errors
- **404**: Session not found -> `ErrorModal`

**On success:** Show `SuccessModal` "Dispute submitted successfully", refresh session detail to show dispute status.

**Existing dispute display:**
- If a dispute already exists on the session, show its status badge: `pending` -> warning, `approved` -> success, `rejected` -> error
- Show dispute description and any admin review notes

