## Gate Marker

**STOP** — Break start/end cycle must work on the Clock page, and the My Hours page must display session history with dispute submission before Sprint 7 begins. Confirm:
1. Start Break creates a break entry on the active session
2. End Break completes the break
3. SessionDurationTimer pauses during break
4. My Hours page loads paginated session history
5. Session detail shows breaks and dispute status
6. Dispute submission creates a dispute record

